{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":38.439998626708984,"text":"A marble goddess, a little taller than a person, at 1.93 meters, stands as if you had walked in on her bath. One hand covers her chest, and the other her body. She is a Roman copy from the 2nd century AD, made after a Greek model that goes back to the sculptor Praxiteles. She was found on the Viminal Hill between 1670 and 1676, and in 1752, Pope Benedict XIV bought her and gave her to the museum. Napoleon took her to Paris, too. She returned in 1816. She has a small room of her own, so that you can walk all the way round her.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.6000000238418579},{"word":"marble","start":0.6000000238418579,"end":0.9399999976158142},{"word":"goddess","start":0.9399999976158142,"end":1.399999976158142},{"word":"a","start":1.7599999904632568,"end":1.9600000381469727},{"word":"little","start":1.9600000381469727,"end":2.1600000858306885},{"word":"taller","start":2.1600000858306885,"end":2.4200000762939453},{"word":"than","start":2.4200000762939453,"end":2.6600000858306885},{"word":"a","start":2.6600000858306885,"end":3},{"word":"person","start":3,"end":3.119999885559082},{"word":"at","start":3.380000114440918,"end":3.5999999046325684},{"word":"1","start":3.5999999046325684,"end":3.940000057220459},{"word":"93","start":3.940000057220459,"end":4.579999923706055},{"word":"meters","start":4.579999923706055,"end":5.059999942779541},{"word":"stands","start":5.659999847412109,"end":5.840000152587891},{"word":"as","start":5.840000152587891,"end":6.21999979019165},{"word":"if","start":6.21999979019165,"end":6.320000171661377},{"word":"you","start":6.320000171661377,"end":6.519999980926514},{"word":"had","start":6.519999980926514,"end":6.78000020980835},{"word":"walked","start":6.78000020980835,"end":6.960000038146973},{"word":"in","start":6.960000038146973,"end":7.260000228881836},{"word":"on","start":7.260000228881836,"end":7.380000114440918},{"word":"her","start":7.38000011444091